IR Content:
```yaml
xcpgir_version: "1.0"
rule:
  id: aiopg-sqli
  kind: taint
  severity: WARNING
  message: "Detected string concatenation with a non-literal variable in an aiopg Python SQL statement. This could lead to SQL injection if the variable is user-controlled and not properly sanitized. In order to prevent SQL injection, use parameterized queries instead."
  metadata:
    language: python
    category: security
    cwe: "CWE-89: Improper Neutralization of Special Elements used in an SQL Command ('SQL Injection')"
    technology: aiopg
    owasp:
      - "A01:2017 - Injection"
      - "A03:2021 - Injection"

sources:
  - id: NON_LITERAL_VAR
    match:
      node: ASSIGNMENT
      where:
        - op: or
          conditions:
            - op: regex
              left: right.value
              right: ".+\+.+"
            - op: regex
              left: right.value
              right: ".+\+=.+"
            - op: regex
              left: right.value
              right: ".format\(.+\)"
            - op: regex
              left: right.value
              right: ".%\(.+\)"
            - op: regex
              left: right.value
              right: "f'.+\{.+}.*'"

sinks:
  - id: SQL_EXEC
    match:
      node: CALL
      api: 
        type: aiopg
        method: execute
      arg_index: 0
      where:
        - op: regex
          left: methodFullName
          right: ".*execute.*"

sanitizers:
  - id: PARAMETERIZED_QUERY
    match:
      node: CALL
      api:
        type: aiopg
        method: execute
      where:
        - op: and
          conditions:
            - op: regex
              left: arg[0].value
              right: ".*%s.*"
            - op: neq
              left: arg[1]
              right: null
    effect: neutralize

propagations:
  - id: STRING_CONCAT
    edge: arg->param
    kind: taint
```
Valid: ```yaml
issues:
  - sources节点中缺少对SQL查询构建环境的匹配(pool/connection等)，可能导致误报
  - sanitizers节点的匹配条件过于宽松，应限制为仅匹配参数化查询的形式
  - propagations节点缺少对字符串操作(concat/formating等)的显式传播路径描述
  - 改进建议:
    - 在sources节点中添加对aiopg连接池/游标环境的匹配条件
    - 严格限制sanitizers为正确使用参数化查询的情况
    - 添加字符串操作(concat/format等)的传播路径描述
```
